✖︎ Server-owned document `ServerCard_user` cannot spread `@inline` fragment `RendererName_user` because it spreads client fragment `RendererName_plainRenderer`: the server reads `@inline` data, so that client fragment's data would not be handed off to the client. Spread `RendererName_plainRenderer` with `@alias` directly in the server-owned document instead.

